OL,3,GNEWSAPools to be rebuilt in leisure
OL,4,Acentre revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe redevelopment of a leisure centre
OL,7,Fis likely to cost significantly more
OL,8,Fthan originally planned - after
OL,9,Fstructural engineers recommended
OL,10,Fdemolishing and rebuilding the ageing
OL,11,Fpool and facility.
OL,13,FFenland District Council plans to
OL,14,Ftransform the Manor Leisure Centre in
OL,15,FWhittlesey, near Peterborough, as part
OL,16,Fof a project originally valued at
OL,17,F#18.67m.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
PN,37302
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1790832383
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPools to be rebuilt in leisure
OL,4,Acentre revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Chris Boden, leader of Fenland
OL,7,FDistrict Council, told a meeting how
OL,8,Frising construction costs and the
OL,9,Fincreased scale of the redevelopment
OL,10,Fmeant the final figure would be higher.
OL,12,F"We are now talking about a larger
OL,13,Fproject than we were talking about
OL,14,Fbefore," added Boden, a Conservative
OL,15,Fcouncillor.
